[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196018032","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109723#issuecomment-3196018032","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109723","id":3196018032,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-f11w","user":{"login":"adamwych","id":6526954,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MjY5NTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6526954?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych","html_url":"https://github.com/adamwych","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T10:05:57Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T10:05:57Z","body":"Removing this flag introduces an issue with `Input.warp_mouse`.\r\n\r\nThis script warps the mouse upon LMB release, and continuously prints mouse position (according to `Viewport.get_mouse_position`).\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node3D\r\n\r\nvar pressed: bool\r\n\r\nfunc _process(_dt: float) -> void:\r\n\tif Input.is_mouse_button_pressed(MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT):\r\n\t\tpressed = true\r\n\telse:\r\n\t\tif pressed:\r\n\t\t\tpressed = false\r\n\t\t\tInput.warp_mouse(Vector2(100, 100))\r\n\t\t\tprint('RELEASED')\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\tprint(get_viewport().get_mouse_position())\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n```bash\r\n(459.0, 93.5)\r\nRELEASED\r\n(437.0, 94.5) # should be (100, 100)\r\n(437.0, 94.5)\r\n# ... now after I move the mouse:\r\n(99.0, 98.5)\r\n```\r\n\r\nmaster - with the flag a similar issue exists, but it \"fixes itself\" after a couple of frames:\r\n```bash\r\n(612.0, 284.0)\r\nRELEASED\r\n(612.0, 284.0)\r\n(612.0, 284.0)\r\n(612.0, 284.0)\r\n(96.0, 94.0) # (no mouse move, it fixed itself)\r\n```\r\n\r\n(Note that in the `master` example I manually transformed the position to make it easier to compare. The position is returned in global screen coordinates, and with negative Y, which is what this PR fixes)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196018032/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196278991","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109723#issuecomment-3196278991","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109723","id":3196278991,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-g1jP","user":{"login":"adamwych","id":6526954,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MjY5NTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6526954?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych","html_url":"https://github.com/adamwych","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T11:33:53Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T11:33:53Z","body":"I tested your latest change, and it mostly works fine, but sometimes there's a slight delay.\r\n\r\nI added a 2D rect to visualize the position (`texture_rect.global_position = get_viewport().get_mouse_position()`):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b0675811-e16b-489e-ba4a-f17f40f80084\r\n\r\nIf you play it slower you can see that the rectangle stays in the old spot for a couple of frames.\r\nWhile it still fixes itself eventually, this issue is noticeable in my game, as it relies on warping the mouse on release to keep mouse locked onto an enemy.\r\n\r\nI don't know if this is macOS-specific or a general Godot issue, though.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196278991/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196288552","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109723#issuecomment-3196288552","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109723","id":3196288552,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-g34o","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T11:37:04Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T11:37:04Z","body":"It's working over IPC, so some delay is inevitable (in the current implementation, we probably should add full screen and window info to the embedded DS in the future).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196288552/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3196329765","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109723#issuecomment-3196329765","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109723","id":3196329765,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-hB8l","user":{"login":"adamwych","id":6526954,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MjY5NTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6526954?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych","html_url":"https://github.com/adamwych","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamwych/received_events","type":"User","user_view_t